# BGA-state comparison: the practice script without key presses during the song (every
# note a deterministic miss), with per-frame hashes of the
# BGA object pool and VM state. beatmania III The Final: boot -> attract -> 2 coins -> mode select -> the
# practice stage ("Instant Love", DJ KONAMI tutorial), keys pressed in a fixed
# pattern so the judge, keysounds and BGA hit/miss hooks all fire.
# Reference trace for M2-M5. Deterministic: same inputs, same frames.
game bm3final
watch measure u32 0x80103674
watch scene u32 0x802566dc
hash objpool 0x80146750 0x8014a750
hash vmvars 0x80255de0 0x80256700


at 3600 mark coin
at 3600 press "Coin 1" 8
at 3630 press "Coin 1" 8
at 3700 press "1 Player Start" 12
at 4000 mark mode-select
at 4000 press "P1 Button 1" 8       # mode select: confirm (kobako)
at 4400 press "P1 Button 1" 8       # sound select: confirm (practice stage)
at 4700 press "P1 Button 1" 8
at 4800 mark song

at 5400 dump sda 0x80100000 0x80110000
at 9000 dump sda 0x80100000 0x80110000
from 3600 every 300 snap
at 12000 quit
